WEBVTT

00:21.800 --> 00:23.800
Adults say

00:24.320 --> 00:27.080
that a school is a safe

00:29.280 --> 00:31.960
and innocent place.

00:34.000 --> 00:34.840
DIARY OF GOOD DEEDS

00:39.280 --> 00:42.240
It's a place free from violence.

00:43.720 --> 00:45.800
However, the outside world...

00:47.160 --> 00:48.800
brings violence into school.

00:55.160 --> 00:56.040
Is it true?

02:24.400 --> 02:25.440
Why are you slacking off?

02:26.000 --> 02:27.360
Finish your work.

02:27.440 --> 02:28.880
I have other things to do.

02:29.440 --> 02:30.800
That's your problem.

02:31.160 --> 02:32.000
I have time.

02:34.840 --> 02:35.680
Wait.

02:36.520 --> 02:38.000
If that hits me,

02:38.080 --> 02:39.760
I will report you to the PTA.

02:39.840 --> 02:40.920
I'll tell them what you did.

02:43.600 --> 02:44.600
What?

02:44.920 --> 02:46.360
Such a shame.

02:47.320 --> 02:48.960
Are you scared of the PTA?

02:50.920 --> 02:51.960
If that's how you feel,

02:52.040 --> 02:53.360
then we'll just stay here.

02:54.320 --> 02:56.600
You won't be the only one
that doesn't get to go home.

02:57.200 --> 02:58.360
No one here will go home.

02:58.920 --> 03:00.040
Why?

03:01.200 --> 03:03.440
It's his problem. I can't stay here.

03:03.760 --> 03:06.400
I have to work on activities
to welcome new students.

03:06.480 --> 03:08.000
Me too. I have to go home

03:08.080 --> 03:11.160
to edit my YouTube videos
which I upload every Tuesday.

03:11.240 --> 03:12.520
If you want to leave,

03:12.600 --> 03:14.200
tell Koh to finish his work.

03:14.280 --> 03:16.080
I want to go home, too.
My daughter is waiting.

03:16.160 --> 03:17.080
Koh.

03:18.240 --> 03:19.400
Koh, do your work.

03:19.480 --> 03:20.520
What if I don't?

03:21.080 --> 03:22.160
Give me your work.

03:22.240 --> 03:23.080
I'll do it for you.

03:23.160 --> 03:24.040
No.

03:24.640 --> 03:25.880
He has to do it.

03:28.640 --> 03:30.680
Koh, do it now.

03:31.480 --> 03:33.200
Think about your friends.

03:34.720 --> 03:36.440
Fine. I'll do some work for you.

03:36.840 --> 03:38.120
I will do this one for you, Kaew.

03:38.680 --> 03:40.320
I will do this one for you, Duang.

03:40.880 --> 03:41.840
As for this question,

03:42.560 --> 03:44.520
I will do it for his daughter.

03:45.400 --> 03:46.640
Daddy.

03:46.720 --> 03:47.800
Tang.

03:49.640 --> 03:50.960
I don't need to do it for her now.

03:51.040 --> 03:52.320
His daughter is here.

03:53.720 --> 03:56.000
This damn kid came in at the worst time.

03:56.560 --> 03:57.760
Daddy, can I play a game?

03:57.840 --> 03:58.760
Sure.

03:58.840 --> 03:59.920
Look at that.

04:00.000 --> 04:01.480
If she gets to play games,

04:01.840 --> 04:02.720
I'm not doing my work.

04:03.320 --> 04:04.440
Koh.

04:12.360 --> 04:13.240
Close the door.

04:14.360 --> 04:16.120
-Close the door.
-What on earth are you doing?

04:16.200 --> 04:18.040
-Just close the door.
-What the hell?

04:18.120 --> 04:19.079
Get out of the way.

04:20.440 --> 04:22.440
What's going on?
What the hell is going on?

04:22.520 --> 04:23.440
Close the door.

04:24.000 --> 04:24.960
Close the door.

04:25.480 --> 04:26.640
Close the door.

04:36.400 --> 04:37.480
What's going on?

04:37.960 --> 04:39.600
-What happened?
-I don't know.

04:40.240 --> 04:41.760
I heard that a prisoner escaped.

04:41.840 --> 04:44.120
They're in our school uniform
and stabbing people.

04:44.680 --> 04:46.320
-That's why we ran here.
-What?

04:46.880 --> 04:47.920
Is that true, Suer?

04:48.000 --> 04:49.640
Yes, I saw it with my own eyes.

04:49.720 --> 04:51.560
A kid was stabbed in the throat

04:51.640 --> 04:53.520
over and over like this.

04:53.600 --> 04:55.920
I also heard that someone
got their face slashed.

04:56.000 --> 04:57.320
How many of them are there?

04:57.400 --> 04:58.400
I don't know.

04:58.480 --> 05:00.400
Hang on. Just calm down.

05:02.320 --> 05:03.920
Block the door with the chairs and desks.

05:04.000 --> 05:04.840
Come on.

05:04.920 --> 05:05.760
Right here.

05:08.520 --> 05:09.600
Stop.

05:09.720 --> 05:11.440
Do it quietly.

05:11.680 --> 05:13.320
Do you want them to hear us?

05:14.360 --> 05:16.200
Turn off the lights
and close the windows, too.

05:23.880 --> 05:25.680
Be more quiet.

05:27.880 --> 05:28.760
Koh.

05:29.240 --> 05:30.880
Why aren't you helping your friends?

05:40.880 --> 05:42.040
Gather here, everyone.

05:44.160 --> 05:45.920
Keep as quiet as you can

05:46.320 --> 05:48.000
so the prisoners don't know where we are.

05:50.680 --> 05:52.240
Do I still need to finish my homework?

05:54.160 --> 05:55.280
Koh.

05:55.880 --> 05:57.040
I'm just curious.

05:57.480 --> 05:58.520
He was so serious about it.

05:58.600 --> 05:59.680
Fuck you, Koh.

06:00.000 --> 06:01.040
Can you shut up?

06:01.120 --> 06:03.880
The prisoners will hear us
and come and kill us all.

06:04.440 --> 06:05.680
Are you guys insane?

06:06.160 --> 06:08.240
Do you really believe what these two said?

06:08.800 --> 06:11.200
If you don't believe us,
go and see for yourself.

06:12.560 --> 06:13.440
You're cowards.

06:18.920 --> 06:19.960
Listen up,

06:20.560 --> 06:23.280
all students and staff.

06:23.360 --> 06:25.640
There is an emergency in the school.

06:25.920 --> 06:29.480
A serial killer convicted of eight murders

06:29.920 --> 06:31.400
has escaped from prison.

06:31.760 --> 06:33.240
The prisoner is dressed as a student

06:33.880 --> 06:36.240
and has already injured
three of our students.

06:36.880 --> 06:39.760
I want everyone to remain calm

06:40.120 --> 06:41.600
and stay in groups

06:41.680 --> 06:43.040
until the next announcement...

07:02.160 --> 07:03.320
Are the prisoners gone?

07:05.240 --> 07:06.720
How am I supposed to know?

07:07.360 --> 07:09.240
I saw you using your phone.

07:09.760 --> 07:12.240
I'm trying to call for help, but I can't.

07:14.520 --> 07:16.440
There's no fucking reception
at school today.

07:19.200 --> 07:20.680
Can you get through to anyone?

07:21.840 --> 07:23.280
I can't.

07:23.920 --> 07:25.400
I can't either.

07:26.480 --> 07:28.080
I have some information

07:30.680 --> 07:31.880
about the murderer.

07:32.440 --> 07:33.320
What does it say?

07:33.760 --> 07:35.200
The news says,

07:35.280 --> 07:36.560
"The most terrible Friday.

07:36.640 --> 07:38.880
Who could have known
that a normal, peaceful morning

07:38.960 --> 07:41.520
would turn into the worst day
in the history of the school?

07:41.600 --> 07:43.800
It was on a nice, cool day

07:44.360 --> 07:47.360
that the murderous
female alumnus with a grudge

07:47.440 --> 07:50.360
walked into the school,
smiling like other students.

07:50.800 --> 07:53.440
She grabbed a long knife
out of a black bag,

07:53.520 --> 07:56.000
stabbed it into the victim's throat,

07:56.080 --> 07:58.440
twisted it before pulling it out,

07:58.520 --> 08:00.680
and stabbed it right back in

08:00.760 --> 08:02.680
-again, and again...
-It's okay. Don't be scared.

08:02.760 --> 08:03.840
-And again--"
-That's enough.

08:06.720 --> 08:07.840
Do you have a picture of her?

08:08.720 --> 08:09.960
It's loading.

08:17.200 --> 08:19.200
Look. Wi sent me a message.

08:20.960 --> 08:22.600
She said the murderer is in building one.

08:23.320 --> 08:24.400
What else did she say?

08:26.160 --> 08:27.120
She said the murderer

08:27.520 --> 08:29.040
is coming to building four.

08:29.640 --> 08:32.919
-That's our building, Dad.
-Quiet.

08:33.000 --> 08:34.240
Are you making this up, Boong?

08:34.320 --> 08:35.440
No. Look at it.

08:37.400 --> 08:38.320
Hey.

08:39.679 --> 08:41.600
My friend said she's coming to our floor.

08:42.799 --> 08:43.799
Damn it.

08:44.200 --> 08:45.320
Anyone whose phone works,

08:45.400 --> 08:46.960
text the police to come and help us now.

08:47.920 --> 08:49.360
It won't send.

08:50.040 --> 08:51.320
Can you send a text?

08:51.400 --> 08:53.840
-I can't send a text, too.
-I can't send anything.

08:54.600 --> 08:56.920
What should we do, Dad? I'm scared.

08:57.000 --> 08:58.120
It's okay, Tang.

08:58.200 --> 08:59.520
It's okay.

09:14.480 --> 09:15.480
Keep quiet.

09:19.280 --> 09:21.840
-Keep quiet, Tang.
-Shut up, you crazy kid.

09:21.920 --> 09:22.960
The murderer will hear us.

09:23.040 --> 09:25.080
Shut up. Don't order my kid around.

09:25.160 --> 09:26.760
Both of you, shut up.

09:41.160 --> 09:44.840
-She's gone.
-She's gone.

09:44.920 --> 09:46.520
-We're safe now.
-Are we safe now?

09:47.440 --> 09:48.480
I don't know.

09:48.560 --> 09:49.520
What are people saying?

09:51.200 --> 09:52.360
The reception is gone.

09:52.440 --> 09:53.600
Be quiet.

09:54.360 --> 09:56.120
I can hear something.

10:05.360 --> 10:07.160
Is she back?

10:07.240 --> 10:08.240
Shut up, shithead.

10:09.720 --> 10:10.960
Oh, my god!

10:12.520 --> 10:15.920
Help us! Could you please
open the door for us?

10:16.600 --> 10:17.840
Help!

10:18.920 --> 10:20.560
-Help me!
-Hey! Wait!

10:20.640 --> 10:22.560
Don't open it!

10:22.960 --> 10:24.560
-What are you doing?
-What the hell?

10:25.760 --> 10:27.960
How can we tell

10:28.040 --> 10:29.160
if she is a student

10:29.240 --> 10:31.520
or the murderer tricking us
into opening the door for her?

10:31.600 --> 10:32.440
We don't know.

10:32.520 --> 10:34.920
For our safety, I forbid you
to open the door no matter what.

10:35.000 --> 10:37.240
What if she's not the murderer,
but a student?

10:37.320 --> 10:38.840
Are you going to let her die out there?

10:38.920 --> 10:40.320
How can we tell?

10:40.720 --> 10:42.320
She might come in and kill us all.

10:42.400 --> 10:43.720
What if she's not?

10:44.080 --> 10:46.240
Will you let her die?
What kind of teacher are you?

10:47.560 --> 10:49.960
I don't know.
I can't risk my daughter's life.

10:50.320 --> 10:52.960
You only care about your daughter.
How about others?

10:53.640 --> 10:55.080
I will open the door!

10:55.160 --> 10:56.960
I said no!

10:57.040 --> 10:59.440
-I said no.
-Kaew! Open the door now!

11:00.240 --> 11:01.400
I won't let you!

11:03.440 --> 11:04.280
What?

11:04.360 --> 11:05.680
What is wrong with you?

11:05.760 --> 11:07.000
Did you have to hurt her?

11:07.080 --> 11:07.960
I don't care.

11:08.680 --> 11:10.440
If I must protect my child as a father,

11:10.520 --> 11:11.840
then I will protect my child.

11:11.920 --> 11:14.120
Doesn't the girl out there
have a father, too?

11:15.320 --> 11:16.640
Shut up!

11:21.120 --> 11:22.640
You guys can stop fighting.

11:28.280 --> 11:29.360
She's dead.

11:30.040 --> 11:30.920
-What?
-What?

11:31.000 --> 11:31.960
Shit.

11:40.600 --> 11:41.680
You are a murderer!

11:41.760 --> 11:42.640
How am I a murderer?

11:42.720 --> 11:43.600
You killed her.

11:43.680 --> 11:44.760
I helped you guys.

11:44.840 --> 11:45.880
You helped us?

11:46.240 --> 11:47.120
Think about it.

11:47.200 --> 11:48.680
If we let that girl in,

11:48.760 --> 11:50.240
the murderer would've come in, too.

11:50.320 --> 11:51.840
She would've already killed all of you.

11:54.000 --> 11:55.000
What I did

11:55.520 --> 11:56.480
was sacrifice her

11:57.360 --> 11:58.480
to save all of us.

11:58.560 --> 11:59.880
Don't say a word!

12:01.360 --> 12:02.960
You only thought about your daughter.

12:03.040 --> 12:04.320
You didn't think about us at all.

12:04.400 --> 12:05.240
I did.

12:05.320 --> 12:06.200
Liar.

12:06.280 --> 12:08.280
It's obvious that you only care
about your daughter.

12:10.160 --> 12:11.040
Just you wait.

12:11.120 --> 12:12.400
Once I get out of here,

12:12.480 --> 12:14.800
I will tell everyone that you're a teacher

12:14.880 --> 12:16.440
who doesn't care about his students.

12:16.920 --> 12:18.520
And then we will see

12:18.600 --> 12:20.040
how much respect you'll get.

12:20.440 --> 12:21.600
-Koh!
-What?

12:21.680 --> 12:22.720
Can you shut up?

12:23.840 --> 12:25.520
If the murderer is still outside,

12:26.000 --> 12:27.480
she could come back for us.

12:27.560 --> 12:28.960
I think it's too late.

12:29.080 --> 12:31.320
She's probably waiting right by the door.

12:32.560 --> 12:34.040
It's all your fault, Suer.

12:35.360 --> 12:36.920
Why didn't we run away from school?

12:37.360 --> 12:38.720
Why did you run here?

12:39.280 --> 12:40.440
If you are so smart,

12:40.800 --> 12:42.520
why didn't you tell me where to go?

12:44.200 --> 12:45.560
I'm grateful that we found others.

12:46.240 --> 12:47.480
At least we won't die alone.

12:48.960 --> 12:50.440
I will not die here with you.

12:51.040 --> 12:52.160
Can you calm down?

12:53.120 --> 12:54.560
Did you not hear the principal

12:54.640 --> 12:56.200
saying that everything will be fine?

12:57.400 --> 12:59.120
We don't even know if he is alive.

13:00.200 --> 13:01.720
Isn't he dead already?

13:02.040 --> 13:02.880
Koh.

13:03.440 --> 13:05.080
You heard what I heard, didn't you?

13:06.080 --> 13:07.480
He was talking,

13:07.560 --> 13:08.800
then something happened.

13:16.120 --> 13:18.000
This fucking teacher is useless.

13:18.400 --> 13:19.720
He's an adult,

13:20.440 --> 13:21.880
yet he only cares about himself.

13:22.920 --> 13:24.480
How will a prayer help you?

13:25.520 --> 13:28.120
Do you think God will come
and lead you out of here?

13:29.320 --> 13:30.720
Let me tell you,

13:30.800 --> 13:31.840
as of now,

13:31.920 --> 13:33.440
the only thing God can do

13:34.000 --> 13:35.680
is take you and your daughter to heaven.

13:37.960 --> 13:39.040
You little son of a bitch.

13:39.120 --> 13:40.960
-Fuck you!
-Bring it on.

13:41.040 --> 13:42.560
Calm down!

13:42.640 --> 13:45.000
-How could you do that?
-Do you want to die? Fuck you!

13:45.080 --> 13:46.800
You guys can fight if you want to die!

13:47.440 --> 13:49.160
I will no longer stop you idiots!

13:55.080 --> 13:56.360
Should we

13:57.320 --> 13:59.520
find weapons to protect ourselves?

14:00.720 --> 14:02.560
In case the murderer gets in here.

14:06.160 --> 14:07.200
Yes.

14:07.280 --> 14:08.600
What do we have?

14:12.360 --> 14:14.480
This shit is so useless.

14:17.880 --> 14:18.840
Shit.

14:19.520 --> 14:21.080
Tang, do you want this?

14:24.320 --> 14:25.520
Don't be ridiculous.

14:25.600 --> 14:26.600
Sir.

14:27.200 --> 14:28.280
Do you want this?

14:29.480 --> 14:33.000
I saw on the news that a teacher
stabbed some students with a pen.

14:36.040 --> 14:38.120
I found scissors. Do you want them?

14:55.280 --> 14:57.080
I found a box cutter.

14:57.480 --> 14:58.600
Who wants it?

14:59.160 --> 15:00.080
I'll take that.

15:04.880 --> 15:06.280
Do you have no shame

15:06.360 --> 15:07.480
taking it from a student?

15:08.320 --> 15:10.280
I'm stronger and more mature than you.

15:10.360 --> 15:11.760
So, I need something sharper

15:11.840 --> 15:12.840
to protect everyone.

15:13.400 --> 15:15.120
Protect us, like you did
that girl out there?

15:15.680 --> 15:16.680
Bullshit.

15:17.760 --> 15:20.320
Suer, I found another box cutter.

15:22.400 --> 15:23.320
How about you?

15:27.440 --> 15:28.560
Anything else?

15:31.120 --> 15:32.640
I found another metal pipe, Koh.

15:33.000 --> 15:33.960
Take it.

15:36.640 --> 15:37.600
Thanks.

16:06.520 --> 16:08.680
Dad, I'm hungry.

16:14.080 --> 16:15.520
Does anyone have something to eat?

16:18.320 --> 16:19.280
Anyone?

16:20.640 --> 16:22.560
I'm thirsty, too.

16:24.960 --> 16:26.120
Does anyone have water?

16:29.560 --> 16:30.440
Give her some water.

16:31.000 --> 16:31.920
We don't have any.

16:32.360 --> 16:33.400
Don't lie.

16:34.200 --> 16:35.520
I know you have some.

16:35.880 --> 16:37.160
Give the kid some water.

16:37.240 --> 16:39.000
I said we don't have any.

16:39.080 --> 16:40.800
I saw both of you just now.

16:41.960 --> 16:42.920
Give the kid some water.

16:43.000 --> 16:44.320
I said we don't have any.

16:46.560 --> 16:47.760
Let me search you.

16:48.240 --> 16:49.840
-Come here.
-No.

16:59.800 --> 17:01.000
I said we don't have any.

17:03.280 --> 17:04.520
Wait a bit longer.

17:05.040 --> 17:06.640
We will get some water when we get out.

17:06.720 --> 17:07.720
Okay?

17:10.520 --> 17:11.599
Koh.

17:11.680 --> 17:12.920
Did you drink our water?

17:13.000 --> 17:14.280
No, I didn't.

17:14.680 --> 17:15.800
You said you don't have any.

17:17.000 --> 17:18.079
It was my water.

17:18.160 --> 17:19.480
I kept it for my girlfriend.

17:20.040 --> 17:21.240
What do you mean?

17:21.960 --> 17:23.359
You said you didn't have water.

17:24.119 --> 17:26.400
Are you saying that you lied to the kid

17:26.480 --> 17:27.960
to save water for your girlfriend?

17:28.359 --> 17:29.800
What kind of a guy are you?

17:42.840 --> 17:44.160
Is the prisoner gone?

17:48.200 --> 17:49.360
I don't know.

17:50.040 --> 17:51.320
I don't hear anything.

17:51.920 --> 17:53.040
I don't either.

17:53.520 --> 17:54.840
If she was still here,

17:55.360 --> 17:56.840
no one would be alive right now.

17:59.480 --> 18:00.520
Actually,

18:01.080 --> 18:03.520
this might be our only chance to run

18:03.600 --> 18:04.520
before she comes back.

18:04.600 --> 18:05.760
You go ahead.

18:06.960 --> 18:08.720
Go and find someone to help us.

18:08.800 --> 18:09.640
I agree.

18:10.440 --> 18:12.400
If you think this is our only chance,

18:13.160 --> 18:14.320
then go.

18:14.680 --> 18:16.200
Do you expect me to go alone?

18:17.120 --> 18:20.200
I meant all of us could leave together
so we could help each other.

18:20.280 --> 18:22.320
We will die if we all leave.

18:22.400 --> 18:24.080
Do you want me to go and die alone then?

18:24.160 --> 18:25.320
To be honest,

18:25.400 --> 18:28.280
you should go out first, Koh.

18:28.360 --> 18:29.760
If it weren't for you,

18:29.840 --> 18:33.840
Kaew, Mr. Tor and I would have left
before all this happened.

18:33.920 --> 18:35.040
But because of you,

18:35.120 --> 18:36.360
we are stuck here.

18:36.440 --> 18:37.280
What?

18:37.600 --> 18:39.000
If you are going to blame me,

18:39.080 --> 18:42.040
why don't you blame this fucking teacher
for giving us detention?

18:42.120 --> 18:43.120
I did my job.

18:43.520 --> 18:44.800
You didn't do yours.

18:45.400 --> 18:46.400
Great.

18:46.920 --> 18:48.040
Blame everything on me.

18:48.400 --> 18:50.040
Those latecomers
should also blame me then.

18:50.120 --> 18:51.560
I'm not blaming you, Koh.

18:56.280 --> 18:57.200
How about this?

18:58.200 --> 18:59.440
Let's take a vote

19:00.560 --> 19:02.040
on who should go.

19:04.240 --> 19:05.720
If you think Koh should go,

19:06.640 --> 19:07.760
raise your hand.

19:11.800 --> 19:12.680
Sa.

19:13.440 --> 19:14.720
Why aren't you raising your hand?

19:16.720 --> 19:18.080
He shouldn't go out there alone.

19:18.960 --> 19:20.120
I feel bad for him.

19:23.680 --> 19:24.760
This isn't the first time

19:25.640 --> 19:27.000
that you have stuck up for him.

19:28.280 --> 19:29.440
Is something going on?

19:30.440 --> 19:31.440
No.

19:31.520 --> 19:32.840
I just don't want him to get hurt.

19:33.720 --> 19:34.720
Are you sure?

19:37.200 --> 19:39.000
If it makes you feel better,
I'll vote for Koh.

19:39.080 --> 19:40.360
Fuck you.

19:40.640 --> 19:42.040
How could you do that?

19:43.480 --> 19:44.960
Everyone voted for you to leave.

19:45.720 --> 19:47.520
-Go then.
-Do you really think

19:47.600 --> 19:48.960
that I will find help

19:49.040 --> 19:50.560
if I get out?

19:51.040 --> 19:53.720
If I get away,
I won't give a shit about any of you.

19:54.320 --> 19:55.920
Prepare to die in here.

19:56.240 --> 19:57.320
That's true.

19:57.400 --> 19:59.000
If all of you did that to me,

19:59.440 --> 20:00.960
I wouldn't call for help either.

20:01.040 --> 20:02.360
Let me ask you.

20:02.760 --> 20:03.960
Who are you?

20:04.560 --> 20:06.640
Why haven't we seen your face before?

20:07.600 --> 20:08.600
I forgot.

20:09.440 --> 20:10.560
Hello.

20:10.640 --> 20:11.920
I'm Nanno.

20:12.400 --> 20:14.440
Today is my first day here.

20:15.120 --> 20:17.760
I'm a new student in grade 11, class four.

20:19.280 --> 20:21.960
I'm a very unlucky new student, right?

20:22.360 --> 20:23.960
On my first day of school,

20:24.440 --> 20:26.680
a prisoner escapes from prison.

20:28.760 --> 20:29.840
How about this, then?

20:30.280 --> 20:31.600
If you feel bad for him,

20:31.680 --> 20:32.800
go with him.

20:33.240 --> 20:34.600
You can get people to rescue us.

20:35.920 --> 20:37.240
I could go with him.

20:39.520 --> 20:41.200
But I still haven't figured out

20:41.800 --> 20:43.800
why I should get people to help you guys.

20:48.600 --> 20:49.600
What about the kid?

20:50.080 --> 20:51.120
Don't you feel bad for her?

20:52.040 --> 20:53.960
How ironic

20:54.560 --> 20:56.800
that the one who lied
and refused to give the kid water

20:57.600 --> 20:58.920
is asking me to have sympathy.

20:59.480 --> 21:02.080
If we had to choose the one
who is most likely to come back for us,

21:02.640 --> 21:04.080
wouldn't it be Mr. Tor?

21:04.640 --> 21:07.080
Because he would have to come back
for his daughter.

21:07.160 --> 21:08.160
If I go,

21:08.240 --> 21:09.920
-I will take Tang with me.
-Also...

21:10.520 --> 21:11.720
you're a teacher.

21:12.120 --> 21:13.880
You are responsible for your students.

21:13.960 --> 21:14.840
Koh.

21:18.760 --> 21:19.680
I'm not going.

21:19.760 --> 21:21.400
Why not? You have a box cutter.

21:21.480 --> 21:22.480
You have one, too.

21:22.560 --> 21:24.120
Why don't we make Suer go?

21:24.480 --> 21:25.960
That's a good idea.

21:26.040 --> 21:28.720
Suer would have to come back for Sa.

21:28.800 --> 21:29.880
I'm not going.

21:30.200 --> 21:31.360
I'm staying with Sa.

21:31.920 --> 21:33.160
Actually,

21:33.600 --> 21:35.120
isn't Kaew in the student council?

21:35.440 --> 21:37.160
So, she should help other students.

21:37.760 --> 21:39.400
But all I have is a pair of compasses.

21:39.960 --> 21:41.600
You can take my cutter.

21:42.240 --> 21:44.280
That's enough. Stop changing the subject.

21:44.680 --> 21:47.160
Everyone voted for you to go,
so you must go. Go.

21:47.720 --> 21:48.920
-That's right.
-Yes.

21:49.000 --> 21:50.040
-Yes.
-Go.

21:50.600 --> 21:52.680
Listen to all of you.

21:53.640 --> 21:54.480
Whatever.

21:54.560 --> 21:58.040
You have to go
and find someone to rescue us.

21:58.120 --> 21:59.680
If you get help,

22:00.520 --> 22:02.160
I'll make sure you pass
this academic year.

22:02.240 --> 22:03.120
Damn.

22:03.760 --> 22:05.120
Is that how you want to play?

22:05.200 --> 22:06.040
Yes.

22:15.760 --> 22:16.720
Fine.

22:17.080 --> 22:18.200
I'll go.

22:57.960 --> 22:58.960
Fuck.

23:00.160 --> 23:01.120
What the hell?

23:01.840 --> 23:02.960
What?

23:03.880 --> 23:05.000
The body is gone.

23:06.760 --> 23:08.200
She came back to get the body.

23:08.640 --> 23:09.600
Fuck.

23:09.960 --> 23:11.080
We were arguing loudly.

23:11.600 --> 23:12.880
She must know that we're in here.

23:13.520 --> 23:16.160
We were arguing
because you wouldn't leave.

23:16.240 --> 23:17.440
Koh.

23:17.520 --> 23:18.520
Listen to me.

23:19.120 --> 23:20.760
Maybe it wasn't the murderer

23:20.840 --> 23:23.280
who took away the body.

23:24.240 --> 23:27.120
Officers may have come to investigate
without knowing that we were in here.

23:27.520 --> 23:28.640
How could they not know?

23:29.040 --> 23:30.240
We were making so much noise.

23:32.560 --> 23:33.520
I'm not going.

23:34.800 --> 23:36.240
If you refuse, then what's your plan?

23:37.000 --> 23:38.240
Will you just sit and wait here?

23:38.760 --> 23:39.760
I will.

23:50.400 --> 23:52.040
If it remains quiet for 15 minutes,

23:52.640 --> 23:53.720
then I'll go.

24:56.280 --> 24:57.840
Someone open the door for me.

25:15.280 --> 25:16.280
Open the door.

25:16.840 --> 25:17.920
You want me to leave, right?

25:40.000 --> 25:41.080
-Koh!
-Shit.

25:41.160 --> 25:42.080
-Hey!
-Kaew!

25:42.880 --> 25:44.240
-What are you doing?
-Open the door.

25:44.320 --> 25:46.920
Koh, what the fuck are you doing?
Let me back in right now.

25:47.000 --> 25:48.720
Wasn't it you who said

25:48.800 --> 25:50.920
that the body disappeared
because officers were here?

25:52.280 --> 25:53.880
If that is what you think, then you go.

25:53.960 --> 25:55.280
I don't believe you.

25:56.040 --> 25:57.760
You're also in the student council.

25:58.120 --> 25:59.440
Your duty is to help others.

25:59.520 --> 26:00.760
Don't make me do it for you.

26:01.240 --> 26:03.080
Fuck you!

26:03.760 --> 26:05.000
You should leave now

26:05.560 --> 26:07.120
before the murderer comes back.

26:07.640 --> 26:08.640
What's wrong?

26:09.440 --> 26:10.400
Do you want to join her?

26:10.960 --> 26:12.720
What a gentleman, pushing a girl outside.

26:12.800 --> 26:13.640
You idiot!

26:13.720 --> 26:15.320
I'm more of a gentleman

26:15.400 --> 26:16.840
than this useless teacher.

26:34.840 --> 26:36.120
Is someone calling you?

26:39.680 --> 26:41.600
It's Kaew. She's video-calling me.

26:43.160 --> 26:44.760
The reception is really bad.

26:51.920 --> 26:52.840
Kaew.

26:55.760 --> 26:56.640
Kaew.

26:59.280 --> 27:00.120
Kaew.

27:00.200 --> 27:01.920
What should we do? She can't hear us.

27:06.800 --> 27:07.760
Boong.

27:07.840 --> 27:10.120
-Boong.
-Kaew. Can you hear me now?

27:11.680 --> 27:12.640
It's...

27:13.720 --> 27:15.360
It's really dark

27:16.200 --> 27:17.960
and very quiet.

27:19.840 --> 27:20.800
As if

27:21.720 --> 27:23.640
nobody is in the school anymore.

27:24.120 --> 27:26.280
Kaew, leave through the front gate

27:26.360 --> 27:28.160
then call for help.

27:28.240 --> 27:29.480
That's what I'm doing right now.

27:29.880 --> 27:30.720
What's wrong, Kaew?

27:32.120 --> 27:32.960
What?

27:34.080 --> 27:35.560
Kaew, get out of there.

27:35.640 --> 27:38.040
-What is it?
-You should leave. Go.

27:38.120 --> 27:39.600
It could be the murderer.

27:40.160 --> 27:42.280
What if it's someone who can rescue me?

27:42.360 --> 27:45.280
Kaew, listen to me.
Leave now. Don't go in.

27:47.840 --> 27:48.800
Kaew.

27:50.360 --> 27:52.800
-It's dangerous. Just leave.
-Fuck.

27:53.840 --> 27:55.360
What the fuck is this?

27:57.760 --> 27:59.480
It's dangerous. Just leave.

27:59.560 --> 28:01.000
Kaew, just leave.

28:01.080 --> 28:01.960
Run.

28:02.480 --> 28:04.080
-Shit.
-Kaew, why are you running away?

28:04.680 --> 28:05.920
Why didn't you ask for help?

28:06.440 --> 28:08.640
Fuck you, Koh. Shut your mouth!

28:08.720 --> 28:10.680
I'm out here because of you.

28:10.760 --> 28:12.080
Once you get out,

28:12.720 --> 28:13.880
I will kill you.

28:13.960 --> 28:14.920
-Kaew.
-Hey!

28:15.000 --> 28:16.920
-I will kill you. Mark my words.
-Kaew.

28:17.000 --> 28:19.360
-Hey! What is that?
-Get out of that place!

28:19.920 --> 28:20.760
No.

28:21.160 --> 28:22.240
I got cut off.

28:26.360 --> 28:27.520
I was cut off.

28:28.560 --> 28:29.800
What should we do?

28:35.000 --> 28:35.840
What?

28:35.920 --> 28:37.400
You pushed Kaew.

28:37.800 --> 28:38.680
You are responsible.

28:38.760 --> 28:40.440
You guys forced me to go.

28:40.520 --> 28:41.760
I didn't want to go.

28:41.840 --> 28:43.000
But I agree.

28:43.760 --> 28:45.560
If someone should go and find Kaew,

28:45.640 --> 28:46.720
it should be Koh.

28:47.480 --> 28:48.480
I agree with you.

28:50.000 --> 28:51.160
But I think...

29:01.560 --> 29:02.400
Fine.

29:03.080 --> 29:04.160
I'll go.

29:04.520 --> 29:06.920
Arguing with all of you
is like arguing with dogs.

29:30.120 --> 29:31.240
Tang.

29:36.280 --> 29:37.600
How can we be sure

29:38.400 --> 29:40.280
that he will actually help Kaew?

29:41.480 --> 29:42.880
He could just take off.

29:43.520 --> 29:44.480
I agree.

29:44.560 --> 29:46.160
Koh is not like that.

29:47.040 --> 29:48.640
He will definitely go and help Kaew.

29:52.280 --> 29:53.800
You've tried to stick up for Koh

29:55.160 --> 29:56.720
so many times now.

29:58.320 --> 29:59.720
You can't forget him, can you?

30:00.680 --> 30:01.760
It's not like that.

30:03.000 --> 30:04.920
I just don't want people to misjudge him.

30:06.800 --> 30:08.680
If you don't believe
that Koh went to help Kaew,

30:09.080 --> 30:10.400
try calling him.

30:23.440 --> 30:24.520
He declined my call.

30:36.880 --> 30:37.920
How's it going, Koh?

30:38.400 --> 30:41.520
I came to look for Kaew
but I can't find her.

30:42.480 --> 30:43.480
See?

30:44.040 --> 30:45.440
I told you that Koh isn't like that.

30:49.200 --> 30:51.800
Since you're out there,
why don't you go and see

30:52.960 --> 30:54.480
if you can find someone to help us?

30:55.440 --> 30:57.000
To be honest,

30:57.080 --> 30:59.120
I don't want to help anyone.

31:03.680 --> 31:05.200
Can you do it for me?

31:07.200 --> 31:08.480
Can you help me?

31:11.240 --> 31:12.240
Fine.

31:13.080 --> 31:14.440
I'll do it right away.

31:14.520 --> 31:15.640
I'll go now.

31:18.240 --> 31:20.280
Someone will come and help us soon.

31:25.440 --> 31:26.480
I need to pee.

31:28.200 --> 31:29.880
You can't go out there. It's dangerous.

31:32.400 --> 31:33.720
Do you want me to pee here?

31:37.000 --> 31:38.800
Koh has gone to get help.

31:39.520 --> 31:40.600
Just wait a bit longer.

31:41.200 --> 31:42.320
I think you should wait here

31:42.920 --> 31:44.280
in case the killer is nearby.

31:45.200 --> 31:46.640
If she forces her way in here,

31:46.720 --> 31:48.360
you and I can protect the others.

31:50.280 --> 31:51.520
You are a strong man.

31:52.640 --> 31:54.280
You can protect the others.

31:55.800 --> 31:56.680
I'm going now.

31:58.200 --> 31:59.200
Suer.

32:23.720 --> 32:25.400
Can anyone else get through to anyone?

32:29.080 --> 32:30.480
Sit down, Sa.

32:42.480 --> 32:43.680
Why are you looking at me?

32:44.800 --> 32:45.920
No reason.

32:48.320 --> 32:49.560
Just say what you want to say.

32:52.440 --> 32:54.320
If we get out of here,

32:55.520 --> 32:57.320
there will probably be an investigation

32:57.640 --> 32:59.240
about the girl who died outside the room.

33:03.320 --> 33:04.920
I did it to protect all of you.

33:05.320 --> 33:06.360
Everyone knows.

33:06.920 --> 33:08.200
Everyone may know,

33:09.120 --> 33:10.080
but Koh...

33:12.200 --> 33:14.640
If Koh finds help for us,

33:15.560 --> 33:17.120
he will be a hero.

33:17.960 --> 33:19.520
People will be more likely

33:20.760 --> 33:22.160
to listen to him

33:22.680 --> 33:23.560
than to you

33:24.640 --> 33:25.560
Suer,

33:25.640 --> 33:26.800
Kaew,

33:26.880 --> 33:27.760
Sa,

33:27.840 --> 33:28.840
Duang,

33:28.920 --> 33:29.840
or Boong.

33:31.000 --> 33:33.400
What kind of father
do you think Tang wants to have?

33:34.440 --> 33:36.200
A father who kept everyone safe

33:36.800 --> 33:38.720
but is known to be a murderer,

33:40.000 --> 33:42.000
or a father who was a hero

33:42.560 --> 33:44.280
because he saved everyone?

34:06.480 --> 34:07.360
Tang.

34:10.120 --> 34:11.520
Stay here.

34:12.920 --> 34:14.320
I will go and get help.

34:15.360 --> 34:16.440
Dad.

34:20.400 --> 34:21.679
But, sir,

34:21.760 --> 34:23.520
what if the killer comes?

34:25.080 --> 34:26.480
You guys will find a way.

34:27.400 --> 34:28.440
I know it.

34:28.520 --> 34:29.960
But, Dad...

34:30.040 --> 34:31.560
I have to go, Tang.

34:54.480 --> 34:55.480
Sa,

34:56.360 --> 34:57.480
close the door behind me.

35:23.600 --> 35:25.600
Why did you have to say that
to make him leave?

35:26.640 --> 35:29.520
Don't you know how scary it is
for us to be left alone?

35:30.800 --> 35:31.800
How scary is it?

35:32.520 --> 35:34.200
We are all girls.

35:35.120 --> 35:36.440
If something happens...

35:38.600 --> 35:39.600
Why are you smiling?

35:47.640 --> 35:48.800
Do you remember

35:49.400 --> 35:51.360
when she showed us
the picture of the murderer?

35:51.920 --> 35:53.840
She had the exact same haircut as Nanno.

35:54.760 --> 35:55.640
That's right.

35:56.120 --> 35:58.360
And she lured all the guys out--

36:04.880 --> 36:06.000
It's you, isn't it?

36:06.080 --> 36:07.280
You are the prisoner.

36:15.360 --> 36:16.920
Is that what you guys think?

36:18.120 --> 36:19.360
Why were you laughing?

36:19.720 --> 36:21.520
You admitted that you are her by laughing.

36:22.320 --> 36:24.040
How could I not laugh?

36:25.120 --> 36:27.240
You guys think that I'm the murderer

36:27.800 --> 36:30.480
even though I was with you

36:31.280 --> 36:32.800
when the killing started.

36:33.680 --> 36:34.800
And Boong,

36:35.320 --> 36:36.480
didn't you say

36:36.920 --> 36:38.000
that you saw the murderer?

36:38.720 --> 36:41.360
It's true that I saw her
but I didn't it see clearly.

36:41.440 --> 36:43.120
It could have been you. Isn't that right?

36:44.360 --> 36:46.760
Didn't someone get stabbed out there

36:46.840 --> 36:49.680
when this lady was in the room with us?

36:52.000 --> 36:53.120
Tang.

36:53.400 --> 36:55.320
You have the intelligence
of those three combined.

36:55.920 --> 36:57.360
Why are you playing with the cutter?

36:58.120 --> 36:59.000
No reason.

37:00.480 --> 37:02.200
I just want to make sure

37:02.760 --> 37:04.280
that it works

37:05.000 --> 37:06.640
in case I need to use it.

37:13.520 --> 37:15.560
Shit. Is that the killer?

37:15.640 --> 37:16.480
Hey.

37:21.000 --> 37:22.280
It's Koh's voice.

37:23.640 --> 37:25.080
Should we go and help Koh?

37:25.160 --> 37:26.480
You are too much.

37:27.160 --> 37:29.240
Suer left a long time ago
but you only care about Koh.

37:30.280 --> 37:32.000
My boyfriend isn't screaming.

37:32.680 --> 37:34.400
If it was Suer,
I would go and help him, too.

37:34.840 --> 37:36.440
-Let's go.
-Wait.

37:37.040 --> 37:38.760
Are you crazy? I'm not going.

37:39.040 --> 37:40.600
You can go alone.

37:41.920 --> 37:45.000
I want to find my dad as well.

37:47.120 --> 37:48.240
I'll go with you then.

37:49.520 --> 37:50.720
Boong.

37:50.800 --> 37:53.040
Why would you want to go?
Someone will come for us soon.

37:53.120 --> 37:55.120
Do you still think
that someone will come to help us?

37:56.200 --> 37:57.920
As long as this kid is with us,

37:58.000 --> 37:59.560
Mr. Tor will come back for her.

37:59.920 --> 38:02.280
The kid just said
she wants to find her dad.

38:02.680 --> 38:05.320
Let's go. I'm worried about my dad.

38:05.400 --> 38:08.400
If you want to stay, then stay.
I'm leaving.

38:08.960 --> 38:10.320
Can you not put pressure on me?

38:10.400 --> 38:12.400
I don't want to stay
with this new student.

38:12.960 --> 38:14.280
Who said I was staying?

38:15.400 --> 38:16.680
I'm going with you.

38:17.280 --> 38:19.920
It's better to stick together.

38:20.400 --> 38:21.840
At least someone will be the bait

38:22.360 --> 38:24.240
when something happens,

38:24.320 --> 38:26.280
so I can run to safety.

38:28.120 --> 38:29.360
Tang.

38:29.640 --> 38:32.200
Are you ready to be the bait?

38:33.160 --> 38:34.160
What are you saying?

38:35.360 --> 38:36.920
No one was thinking that.

38:37.440 --> 38:38.680
Is that so?

38:38.760 --> 38:39.840
I'm sorry.

38:41.960 --> 38:42.960
Wait.

38:44.760 --> 38:45.840
I'll go with you.

38:50.440 --> 38:51.440
Keep quiet.

38:52.040 --> 38:53.160
Keep quiet.

39:10.120 --> 39:12.320
If anyone notices something odd,
say something.

39:12.880 --> 39:13.840
Okay.

39:20.040 --> 39:20.960
What are you doing?

39:21.320 --> 39:24.200
I want to take everyone to my dad.

39:30.560 --> 39:31.640
Call Koh.

39:34.160 --> 39:35.760
If he's with the murderer...

39:36.160 --> 39:37.400
We will go and save him, right?

39:37.480 --> 39:38.560
We will know where he is,

39:38.640 --> 39:39.640
and stay away.

39:42.400 --> 39:43.640
Why are you so horrible?

39:44.840 --> 39:46.200
Sacrifices must be made

39:46.280 --> 39:48.760
for us to survive in situations like this.

39:49.560 --> 39:51.440
I'm thinking of a way to help you guys.

39:53.720 --> 39:54.560
Right.

39:54.640 --> 39:56.120
Boong is right.

39:56.520 --> 39:58.200
Call Koh now. Hurry.

39:58.680 --> 40:00.480
My phone is not working.

40:01.800 --> 40:02.880
Mine's working.

40:05.880 --> 40:07.600
Where is Koh? We will go the other way.

40:12.080 --> 40:13.160
He's over there.

40:14.880 --> 40:15.960
We will head this way.

40:23.600 --> 40:24.600
Fuck!

40:25.600 --> 40:26.440
Fuck.

40:39.440 --> 40:40.480
What's wrong?

40:41.600 --> 40:42.600
Fuck.

40:42.680 --> 40:45.280
Sa didn't take us to safety.

40:45.680 --> 40:47.120
She brought us to Koh.

40:47.200 --> 40:48.560
-What?
-That's not true.

40:49.640 --> 40:50.600
What is not true?

40:50.680 --> 40:52.400
I saw it. Let us look at it then.

40:52.480 --> 40:54.560
-Let go!
-My phone.

40:55.600 --> 40:56.680
Let me see.

40:56.760 --> 40:57.640
No.

40:58.320 --> 41:01.080
You won't show us because
you are taking us to Koh, aren't you?

41:03.040 --> 41:04.600
You guys are selfish.

41:05.040 --> 41:06.440
You only care about yourselves.

41:07.160 --> 41:08.840
You will get us all killed.

41:11.640 --> 41:12.840
You can go alone.

41:34.960 --> 41:36.280
Sa, watch out!

41:40.640 --> 41:41.480
-Kaew.
-Kaew.

41:43.040 --> 41:44.080
Sa.

41:45.240 --> 41:46.800
-What happened?
-Help.

41:48.320 --> 41:49.160
Why?

41:50.320 --> 41:51.280
It's Koh.

41:51.760 --> 41:54.000
-What's wrong with Koh?
-Koh!

42:13.120 --> 42:14.200
Tang!

42:15.600 --> 42:17.280
Are you all right?

42:20.040 --> 42:20.960
What happened?

42:21.040 --> 42:22.520
Call the police now.

42:22.920 --> 42:23.800
What happened?

42:25.160 --> 42:27.120
The prisoner killed Koh.

42:30.120 --> 42:31.600
The prisoner is a monster.

42:33.360 --> 42:34.320
Are you all right?

42:39.080 --> 42:42.720
This evening, a serial killer who was
convicted of killing eight students

42:42.800 --> 42:44.160
broke out of prison

42:44.240 --> 42:46.960
and carried out an attack at the school
she had previously killed at.

42:47.040 --> 42:50.080
The female prisoner
hurt three students before a struggle,

42:50.160 --> 42:53.760
and died after falling from a building
while trying to escape.

42:53.840 --> 42:57.160
Everything has been under police's control

42:57.240 --> 42:58.720
since late evening.

42:58.800 --> 43:00.760
Are you saying that the three students

43:00.840 --> 43:02.520
who were injured are okay now?

43:04.480 --> 43:05.560
They are fine.

43:06.320 --> 43:07.920
This is what has happened so far.

43:08.000 --> 43:09.480
-What?
-We will keep everyone

43:09.560 --> 43:10.840
-How is that possible?
-updated...

43:11.800 --> 43:13.760
Didn't a student die outside our room?

43:15.760 --> 43:16.640
What?

43:18.400 --> 43:19.560
Are you not dead?

43:20.840 --> 43:22.120
I had an asthma attack.

43:22.200 --> 43:24.080
I tend to faint

43:24.160 --> 43:25.520
when I get very scared.

43:31.240 --> 43:32.320
Oh, my...

43:32.800 --> 43:34.040
If that is the case,

43:34.760 --> 43:36.120
then who

43:36.680 --> 43:38.360
killed Koh?

43:45.360 --> 43:46.240
Suer

43:46.600 --> 43:48.440
was overcome with jealousy.

43:52.000 --> 43:55.600
Perhaps Mr. Tor
didn't want Koh to tell people

43:55.680 --> 43:56.840
what really happened.

44:01.320 --> 44:03.760
Or it could have been Kaew
who was angry with Koh

44:03.840 --> 44:05.640
for pushing her out of the room.

44:09.560 --> 44:10.800
To be honest,

44:11.200 --> 44:12.680
if it weren't for Tang,

44:13.040 --> 44:15.880
the three of you would have probably
ganged up and killed me already.

44:15.960 --> 44:16.920
What?

44:17.280 --> 44:18.520
Forget it.

44:19.120 --> 44:20.680
But we should think about

44:21.120 --> 44:23.080
what to do with Koh's body.

44:23.160 --> 44:25.200
I really don't get it.

44:26.240 --> 44:27.680
Let's go, Tang.

44:28.240 --> 44:30.320
Let's find Duang's phone.

44:31.000 --> 44:33.240
I saw the phone fall into the drain.

44:33.680 --> 44:36.000
We need your small hand to get it out.

44:55.920 --> 44:57.320
Can you get it for me?

44:58.000 --> 44:59.560
This phone is very important.

45:03.960 --> 45:06.160
How is it important?

45:06.920 --> 45:09.160
It's not even yours, is it?

45:11.400 --> 45:14.840
That phone recorded everything
that happened in the room.

45:14.920 --> 45:17.160
It will be a very important
piece of evidence

45:17.240 --> 45:19.800
that will be used
to investigate Koh's death

45:19.880 --> 45:23.840
and the person who willingly
let someone die like your father did.

45:26.720 --> 45:27.560
So?

45:27.920 --> 45:29.200
Can you get it?

45:31.920 --> 45:34.600
No, I can't. It's too deep to reach.

45:40.200 --> 45:41.120
Tang.

45:42.000 --> 45:43.440
You're just like your father.

45:44.960 --> 45:47.200
You should enroll at this school
when you're older.

45:47.960 --> 45:49.720
You will fit right in.

45:59.920 --> 46:01.920
Subtitle translation by
Pet-chompoo Sa-ngarmangkang
